  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Reason for Approval\r\n\r\nThe use of the site as a car rental office with an associated valet service is considered appropriate, as it contributes positively to the balance of employment generating uses within the borough, does not harm the appearance of the surrounding green belt and has not resulted in any adverse traffic related impacts and is therefore in accordance with policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development) E.1.5 (Development involving the Loss of or Changes in Employment Uses) ENV-N.1.4 (Development near the Green Belt Boundary) T.1.4 (Car and Cycle Parking and Servicing Facilities for Developments) and T.4.1 (Traffic Implications of New Development) of The London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan.\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The valet service is only to be used for purposes ancillary to the uses of the site as a car rental office and shall not be open to the general public as a separate service.\r\n\r\n"
  ],
